==Description==
Chicks were a Monster designed for Deepwoken that was scrapped.

They were bipedal entities sporting a crystalline body, feathers and a single glowing eye. It was formerly a monster created for the [[Second Layer|Eternal Gale]], much like how the [[Miasmera]] was the precursor to what we now know as the [[Kyrsgarde]], though they never made it out of the concept art phase.
==Trivia==
*Their appearance is similar in some aspects to a fellow scrapped Monster: the [[Miasmera]], probably because they would have been in the same area.

