__TOC__

Crowns are an end-game currency that can be obtained from completing end game activities. 

== Overview ==

=== '''Obtaining''' ===
Crown can be obtained in 3 ways: [[Bosses#World Bosses|World Bosses]], [[World Events]] or [[War Mode]].

* '''World Bosses,''' namely [[Heart of Enmity]], [[The Doom of Caeranthil]], [[Interluminary Parasol]], and [[Elder Primadon, The Titan Warlord|Elder Primadon]] will reward up to 2 Crowns (based on contribution) when defeated.
** [[Scion of Ethiron]] is capped at 1 Crown per kill, based on contribution.
* '''War Mode''' will reward Crowns to the winning guild based on individual contribution and the Warchest score.
* '''World Events''' such as '''Carnival of Hearts''' and '''Battle Royale''' (may need testing) each reward up to two crowns upon victory.

=== '''Usage''' ===
Crowns are able to be exchanged for Knowledge or Notes by interacting with the icon, where the user can choose a desired currency to exchange with. The exchange rate scales with your current level.

