==Description==
Foxes are a species of animal that existed during the [[Old World]],<ref name="DSJournal" /> but have since gone extinct.<ref>While never explicitly stated to be extinct, Simeon Rasmiof's description of them implies they were no longer native to Lumen following the Old World period.</ref>

[[Simeon Rasimof]] once attended a public lecture given by [[Scholar Tullius]] that discussed foxes. During Simeon's time as a [[Memorial Mason]], he recalled the animal while engraving the name of a Diver whose forename was "Fox", and expressed incredulity at the thought of being named after an animal.<ref name="DSJournal" />
